{"key":"moment:4434535","id":"4434535","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1739171156732,"text":"没事我帮你转给她看[emot=acfun,2765/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":24,"likeCount":167,"bananaCount":124,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4434535","source":{"key":"moment:4434429","id":"4434429","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"23682490","name":"AC娘本体","avatar":"f8c099e1d7af3abd58186d5f"},"time":1739116800000,"text":"一件衣服的扣子崩了，我愣是拖到过年回家找妈妈，想让她帮我把扣子缝上\n她正在客厅外放我的新歌，听得我脚趾抠地\n她眼神不好了，线半天穿不进孔，于是叫我帮忙\n常年在外的孩子其实需要一些闲聊时间，才会发现一些“惊喜”。我想问妈妈，你怎么知道我工作的那么多事，还能知道那么多人？\n想问又算了，想到对互联网一知半解的她能找到我的录播，想到很多个我妈看到我直播太晚会打电话问我是否平安到家。\n看到妈妈没有注册登陆的ACFun，看到妈妈眼角的细纹是岁月刺绣的银线。\n疑问戛然而止。","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":93,"likeCount":452,"bananaCount":358,"shareCount":2},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4434429","visibleForFans":true},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":23,"archivedRoots":23,"commentPages":["comments/4434535/all/1.json","comments/4434535/all/2.json"],"hotPages":[],"threads":{},"hotCount":0}